# 6. Key Findings Summary

The assessment identified the following concerns:

- Inconsistent vendor security assessments
- Limited visibility into vendor security practices
- Excessive vendor access permissions
- Incomplete Business Associate Agreements (BAAs)
- Limited monitoring of vendor remote access
- Inconsistent vendor offboarding procedures
- Insufficient review of cloud provider security controls
- Limited centralized tracking of vendor risks

Several strengths were also identified including:

- Existing vendor contracts
- Use of cloud-based services with security features
- Basic remote access controls
- Existing procurement review processes

