# 8. HIPAA & Compliance Assessment

## Findings

- Some vendors handling PHI do not have documented Business Associate Agreements (BAAs).
- Vendor compliance documentation is inconsistently maintained.
- Vendor risk reviews are not formally tracked.

---

## Risk Level

High

---

## Recommendations

- Ensure all vendors handling PHI sign BAAs.
- Maintain centralized vendor compliance records.
- Conduct annual HIPAA vendor reviews.
- Validate vendor breach notification procedures.

---

# 9. Access Control Assessment

## Findings

- Some vendor accounts maintain persistent access after projects end.
- Vendor access reviews are inconsistent.
- Privileged vendor access monitoring is limited.

---

## Risk Level

High

---

## Recommendations

- Implement time-based vendor access.
- Conduct quarterly access reviews.
- Enforce MFA for all vendor accounts.
- Monitor privileged vendor activities.

---

# 10. Cloud Security Assessment

## Findings

- Cloud providers support encryption and security controls.
- Cloud configuration reviews are limited.
- Logging visibility varies between providers.

---

## Risk Level

Medium

---

## Recommendations

- Conduct cloud configuration assessments regularly.
- Review provider compliance certifications.
- Improve cloud monitoring and logging visibility.

---

# 11. Vendor Incident Response Assessment

## Findings

- Vendor breach reporting timelines are inconsistent.
- Escalation procedures are not standardized across vendors.

---

## Risk Level

Medium

---

## Recommendations

- Define vendor incident reporting timelines contractually.
- Require vendors to notify BrightCare Medical Group immediately following security incidents.
- Test vendor incident communication procedures annually.

---

# 12. Vendor Offboarding Assessment

## Findings

- Vendor offboarding procedures are inconsistently documented.
- Some inactive vendor accounts remain enabled.

---

## Risk Level

High

---

## Recommendations

- Implement formal vendor offboarding procedures.
- Remove vendor access immediately after contract termination.
- Review inactive vendor accounts regularly.

---

