# 14. Recommended Remediation Priorities

## Immediate Priorities

- Enforce MFA for all vendor accounts
- Review privileged vendor access
- Complete missing BAAs
- Improve vendor offboarding procedures

---

## Short-Term Priorities

- Conduct vendor security assessments
- Improve remote access monitoring
- Centralize vendor documentation
- Implement quarterly vendor reviews

---

## Long-Term Priorities

- Mature vendor risk management program
- Improve vendor security metrics
- Expand automated vendor monitoring
- Integrate vendor risk into enterprise risk management

---

# 15. Conclusion

Third-party vendors introduce operational, cybersecurity, and compliance risks that must be actively managed to protect BrightCare Medical Group systems, operations, and sensitive healthcare information.

This assessment identified several opportunities to improve vendor governance, access management, compliance oversight, and monitoring capabilities.

Continued investment in vendor risk management processes and security oversight is strongly recommended.

